Appendix
Ad Credits The amount given as Ads credits to you by Uber.
Ad Spends The amount spent on Ads sponsored by you.
Adjustments
Adjustment includes financing payments, withholdings or
one time charges.
Bank payout
The portion of your total payout deposited into your bank
account.
Cash Collected
The portion of your total payout received directly from
customers as cash.
Container Fees
The fee charged for the bottles, containers or bags in the
ordered items.
Marketing
Adjustment
The amount you charge Uber for co-funded marketing
campaigns.
Marketplace Fees
The fee Uber charges you to make your store visible to
potential customers, process payments, provide support
and other related services.
Net Chargeback
Amount
The total amount charged to you for orders reported with
errors.
Net Payout
Total earnings after all fees and adjustments, paid out
through bank transfer, vouchers and/or cash collection
Net Total
Total earnings minus Uber Fees, Marketing charges and
Amendments
Offers On Items The discounts on food sponsored by you.
Other Charges
Other earnings such as Delivery Fee in case of Delivery
with your own staff
Other Earnings
The Charges other than Marketplace Fees such as
Accelerated remittance fee and Withholding towards Uber
Direct Invoice.
Other Offer
Charges
Other offers charges such as promos on food delivery
sponsored by you.
Sales
The total values of the items sold excluding deductions
such as marketplace fees and other charges.
Tips
The voluntary amount given by customers to the
restaurant or delivery person/courier.
Vouchers The portion of the payments made through vouchers
FARE (Oak Park)
1000 Lake Street , Oak Park, US,
60301
Appendix
Marketplace
Facilitator Tax
The tax collected and remitted by the "Marketplace
Facilitator" (Uber Eats) directly to the tax authorities. It
typically applies in jurisdictions where the platform is
legally responsible for the sales tax on behalf of the
merchant
Net Tax On
Chargeback Tax adjustments due to chargebacks
Tax On
Adjustments
The specific tax portion associated with "Adjustments"
which constitutes multiple financial entries including
financing payments, withholdings or one-time charges
Tax on Container
Fees
Tax on Container Fees collected and passed on to you
Tax on
Marketplace Fees
Total taxes on marketplace fees collected by Uber
Tax on Net Ad
Spends
Total taxes on ad spends made by you
Tax on offer
spends
Total taxes on offer spends made by you
Tax On Other
Charges
The tax applied to "Other Charges," which are earnings
beyond standard marketplace sales, such as delivery fees
earned if you use your own staff for delivery
Tax on Other
Earnings
Tax collected on Other Earnings and passed on to you
Tax on Sales
Tax on Sales collected and passed on to you based on your
store's location.
